{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Segoe UI;}}\f0\fs24\b Magic Trackpad Setup\b0\par
Magic Trackpad Setup is community software for Windows 11 x64. After installation, open Magic Trackpad Setup from Start and select Set up driver. Driver setup downloads the official MagicTrackpad2ForWindows v2.3 release and verifies its checksum.\par
\par Magic Trackpad Setup's original code is available under the MIT License included with its source. The upstream driver and control panel have their own license.\par
\par Uninstall Magic Trackpad Setup through Settings, Apps, Installed apps. The driver stays available to your trackpad.\par}

